OL,3,GNEWSAPeel lifeboat chief retires after
OL,4,A45 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn 1981, Allen Corlett walked into Peel
OL,7,Flifeboat station hoping to join the
OL,8,Fcrew, but failed the eyesight test.
OL,10,FHe was instead asked to join the branch
OL,11,Fcommittee - a group of volunteers who
OL,12,Frun the operation in the background.
OL,14,FIt was the start of a 45-year
OL,15,Finvolvement with the RNLI, with Corlett
OL,16,Fbecoming lifeboat operations manager.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
