OL,3,GNEWSAPeel lifeboat chief retires after
OL,4,A45 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhile he has now retired, the Corlett
OL,7,Fname will still be closely associated
OL,8,Fwith the station, as both of his sons
OL,9,Fnow volunteer there, continuing a
OL,10,Ffamily connection with Peel's lifeboat
OL,11,Fthat stretches back more than 100
OL,12,Fyears.
